hose of any private citizen, no legal protection an officer has, and no backup — and a confrontation that goes wrong makes you both a victim and a defendant."}],"$L1a"]}],"$L1b","$L1c","$L1d","$L1e","$L1f"]}]]}]]}]}]]}],false,false,"$L20",false,"$undefined","$L21","$L22"]}]
